# Local tooling state: agent worktrees are full repo copies, and the code index is local only.
.claude
.codegraph
docs
# The server image builds only api, worker and web. Keep the other workspaces' manifests so the
# lockfile still matches the workspace, but leave their sources out of the build context.
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
apps/desktop/*
!apps/desktop/package.json
apps/www/*
!apps/www/package.json
